  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7e76c79f1aa7df4391b0909e0ea0543, type: 3}
  m_Name: queen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AssassinMystery::AssassinMystery.SuspectData
  id: queen
  displayName: Queen Isolde
  role: Queen of Aldmere
  profile: The intended target? She refuses to cancel the feast or her toast.
  coatColor: {r: 0.9137255, g: 0.88235295, b: 0.8117647, a: 1}
  accentColor: {r: 0.7882353, g: 0.6313726, b: 0.23137255, a: 1}
  skinColor: {r: 0.9098039, g: 0.78039217, b: 0.65882355, a: 1}
  headwear: 1
  heightScale: 1
  beard: 0
  greeting: So you are the Captain's detective. I will not cancel my feast over an
    unsigned note. Find your villain before the vesper bell, or stand beside me while
    I drink.
  topics:
  - question: Please, do not drink the toast.
    response: Two hundred years of Aldmere queens have raised that cup at midwinter.
      I will not be the first to be frightened from it.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: Who would want you dead?
    response: A queen has enemies the way a dog has fleas. My brother sulks, Lady
      Seraphine schemes, and Doctor Mordaunt has glared at me since I dismissed him.
      And after tonight's announcement, I expect a few more.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
  - question: What announcement?
    response: That is Lord Halvard's to read, not mine to spoil. Ask him, if you
      must.
    recordInNotebook: 1
    requiresClue: {fileID: 0}
    revealsClue: {fileID: 0}
